{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is full of monsters that want to kill you. Your mission is to survive, but pay attention and keep you heart and sould under controll, because - you can become a new monster of this place.  <br> <br>This is typical Survivor Rogue Like game. <br>Plying this variant of game you will find next interesting points:  <br> <br>1) Comon skill system ( each hero has 10-20 skills that dont make special combo. You dont need guides, youtube video or knowledge in the chemistry. Skills are simple and clear enough. But to win  you have to choose a right strategy , taking into account the random way skills come.\u00a0 Some skills are very usefull , some are not ,even if they look so. Some of them need to be learned once, other need to maximize. Anyway it wont be easy , if you are not a genius)   <br> <br>2) 3 different heroes with different skills and controlls , what creates cause to change your fight strategy and get new experience. Game wont be the same. <br> <br>3) Retro style of the game but in 3D variant. <br> <br>4) Posability to get your best score and overcome your own limit. Become best variant of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"FirstOne","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3955460/162cce4c4e4b4f523aab853b94a0109378df856a.jpg"},{"name":"Complete Grux Arena","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3955460/1414ab0b9ac77e839ff32638bec97381b6d1910c.jpg"},{"name":"Complete Spider Village ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3955460/1414ab0b9ac77e839ff32638bec97381b6d1910c.jpg"},{"name":"Complete Magic Golem Side","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3955460/1414ab0b9ac77e839ff32638bec97381b6d1910c.jpg"},{"name":"Grux Arena 3500","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/